
# ECCLESIARCHY TENTATIVE FACTION LIST
#
# TIER 1 TROOPS: Zealots, Frateris Militia, Frateris Beastmen, Frateris Preachers, Conflagrator
# TIER 1 ELITES: Missionary, Salvationist, Confessor, Witchfinder Acolyte
# TIER 2 TROOPS: Frateris Veterans, Confessor-Sergeants, Persecutors, Questkeepers, Pyroclasts, Sisters Oblatia, Kasrkin Drill-Abbots
# TIER 2 ELITES: Oblationist Explicator, Sister Dialogus, Miraculist, Confessor-Militant, Witchfinder Explicator
# TIER 3 TROOPS: Oblationist Sin-eaters, Crusaders, Oblationist Tech-priests, Banishers, Hexorcists, Oblationist Stormtroopers
# TIER 3 ELITES: Oblationist Interrogator, Oblationist Inquisitor, Cardinal, Forsaken Priest, Oblationist Possessed, Oblationist Daemonhost
# SPECIAL UNITS: Blessed Gun-Servitors, Chrono-gladiators, Arco-flagellants, Penitent Engines, Cherubim
#
# ALL TIERS HAVE ACCESS TO EQUIVALENT ADEPTA SORORITAS UNITS IN SUPPORT
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#

